refentry.refsect1:
&reftitle.description;

 stringfalsesession_save_path
 stringnullpath&null;


 session_save_path returns the value of the
 session.save_path
 configuration directive, and optionally changes it.

&reftitle.errors;

 Throws a ValueError if
 path contains a null byte.

&reftitle.changelog;
&Version; &Description;
8.0.0
path is nullable now. A null byte in path now throws a ValueError; previously an E_WARNING was raised and &false; was returned.
7.2.0
Changing the path when a session is active or when headers have already been sent now emits an E_WARNING and returns &false;.
